                    },
                    "message": "instead of having new API, can we use existing API updateVpdKeyword() and update the i_paramsToWriteData with sanitised keyword value in the API itself.\nin that case below repackaging can also be avoided ."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/manager.cpp",
                    "line": 199,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "If we change parameter in existing API from `const` reference to reference, we would have to change code in all the places where `updateVpdKeyword` is being called. This is why I added this overload."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/manager.cpp",
                    "line": 199,
                    "reviewer": {
