                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "Why do we need a new API for this? Keep it simple?\n-> After update, read the value from DBus.\n-> If i/p parameter value is different from Dbus, update parameter else not.\n-> Update inherited FRUs with input parameter value."
                },
